# Take the WebSocket connection on /screen.
#
# A real deployment gates this the way any upgrade is gated (a session
# cookie, an Origin allowlist, `state.user`); this example keeps it open so
# it runs with nothing configured. Everything past the accept is trusted for
# the life of the session: the stack decided, once, that this connection may
# bind the workspace's browser.
WHEN @websocket.upgrade == true && @web.req.url.path == "/screen"
  EXEC "txco://websocket/accept"
